 PROGRAM-ID. PB-PUT-BE-INTEGER.
*> USING PB-BUFFER, value (BINARY-DOUBLE), width (BINARY-LONG 1 to 8): the low width bytes of the
*> two's-complement value, big-endian.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-LE                  PIC X(8).
 01 WS-SIGNED REDEFINES WS-LE BINARY-DOUBLE SIGNED.
 01 WS-BE                  PIC X(8).
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 L-VALUE                BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 L-WIDTH                BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING PB-BUFFER L-VALUE L-WIDTH.
     MOVE L-VALUE TO WS-SIGNED
     MOVE FUNCTION REVERSE(WS-LE) TO WS-BE
